  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Integrated Preventive and Curative Nutrition Services in Borno, Yobe and Adamawa States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Treatment of SAM (Severe Acute Malnutrition) with medical complication in SC located in general hospitals._x000d_
2. Treatment of SAM without medical complication in OTPs, community based MUAC screening and referral to OTPs for identified SAM through Mother MUAC approach and Biannual Mass screening._x000d_
3. Capacity building of health workers and nutrition staff._x000d_
4. Social and Behavioural change communication interventions including promotion of optimum Maternal, Infant and Young Child Nutrition (MIYCN)._x000d_
5. Distributing IFA for PLWs, MNP supplementation and Kitchen Gardening.</narrative>
  </description>
